530
00:25:27.430 --> 00:25:36.150
<v Speaker 2>It is a fear of a law that is so absolute, so structurally sound within the individual psychology that it entirely prevents any drift into innovation.

531
00:25:36.310 --> 00:25:37.990
<v Speaker 1>It protects the bounds of the path.

532
